### Get Shopping Results - Default Search
GET http://localhost:3000/api/shopping?q=iPhone

###

### Get Shopping Results - With Price Filter and Sorting
GET http://localhost:3000/api/shopping?q=iPhone&min_price=200&max_price=800&sort_by=1

###

### Get Shopping Results - High to Low Price
GET http://localhost:3000/api/shopping?q=MacBook&sort_by=2

###

### Test Missing Required Query Parameter (Error Handling)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/shopping